{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-adapter-catalog","title":"主流 chat platform 适配清单","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/platform-adapter-catalog","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"主流-chat-platform-适配清单\">主流 chat platform 适配清单</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 把&quot;多个 chat platform 当成统一 agent 工作台&quot;的前提是：在 inbound / outbound 两个方向上，五种主流 chat platform 的 API 形态有大量差异——OAuth 流程、webhook vs long-poll、message schema 字段命名、rate limit 颗粒度。这些差异不能在路由层抹掉，必须先在 adapter 层抽象出一个统一的 <code>Message</code> / <code>Event</code> / <code>Action</code> 模型。本篇按&quot;五个平台横向对照 + adapter 抽象 + rate limit 对比&quot;三块讲清，路由 DSL 走 <a href=\"routing-rules-syntax\"><code>./2_routing-rules-syntax.md</code></a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  L[&quot;飞书 Open API&quot;] --&gt; AD[&quot;Adapter 层&quot;]&#10;  S[&quot;Slack Bolt SDK&quot;] --&gt; AD&#10;  T[&quot;Telegram Bot API&quot;] --&gt; AD&#10;  D[&quot;Discord.js gateway&quot;] --&gt; AD&#10;  M[&quot;Matrix protocol&quot;] --&gt; AD&#10;  AD --&gt; R[&quot;统一 Message 模型&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; RT[&quot;路由 5 级 lookup&quot;]&#10;  RT --&gt; P[&quot;Personas runtime&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  L[\"飞书 Open API\"] --&gt; AD[\"Adapter 层\"]\n  S[\"Slack Bolt SDK\"] --&gt; AD\n  T[\"Telegram Bot API\"] --&gt; AD\n  D[\"Discord.js gateway\"] --&gt; AD\n  M[\"Matrix protocol\"] --&gt; AD\n  AD --&gt; R[\"统一 Message 模型\"]\n  R --&gt; RT[\"路由 5 级 lookup\"]\n  RT --&gt; P[\"Personas runtime\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>接入方式</th>\n<th>实时通道</th>\n<th>双身份支持</th>\n<th>OAuth 复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>飞书</td>\n<td>Open API + webhook</td>\n<td>webhook + 长连接</td>\n<td>bot + user</td>\n<td>中（tenant）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slack</td>\n<td>Bolt SDK</td>\n<td>events API + WSS</td>\n<td>bot + user</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Telegram</td>\n<td>Bot API</td>\n<td>long-poll / webhook</td>\n<td>bot only</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discord</td>\n<td>Discord.js</td>\n<td>gateway WebSocket</td>\n<td>bot only</td>\n<td>中（OAuth2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Matrix</td>\n<td>client-server API</td>\n<td>long-poll / sync</td>\n<td>user-only</td>\n<td>高（联邦）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"飞书-open-api-bot-与-user-双身份\">飞书 Open API：bot 与 user 双身份</h2><p>飞书 Open API 是国内 personal-agent 工具栈最常 anchor 的平台。它把&quot;应用&quot;分两种 token：<code>tenant_access_token</code>（bot 身份，按租户授权）与 <code>user_access_token</code>（user 身份，OAuth code 兑换）。OpenClaw 同时使用两种——bot 用于自动回复 / webhook 接收，user 用于代用户读消息历史 / 发送以用户身份的回复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"lark_adapter:&#10;  app_id: &#39;cli_xxx&#39;&#10;  app_secret: &#39;****&#39;&#10;  tenant_token_endpoint: &#39;/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal&#39;&#10;  user_oauth_endpoint: &#39;/open-apis/authen/v1/access_token&#39;&#10;  webhook_path: &#39;/lark/webhook&#39;&#10;  events:&#10;    - &#39;im.message.receive_v1&#39;&#10;    - &#39;im.chat.member.user.added_v1&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lark_adapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  app_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cli_xxx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  app_secret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'****'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tenant_token_endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  user_oauth_endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/open-apis/authen/v1/access_token'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  webhook_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/lark/webhook'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'im.message.receive_v1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'im.chat.member.user.added_v1'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>飞书 webhook 签名采用 <code>X-Lark-Signature</code> HMAC-SHA256 校验，payload 包含 <code>header.event_type</code> 与 <code>event.message</code> 两层；adapter 把 <code>message.message_id</code> 映射到统一 <code>Message.id</code>，把 <code>chat_id</code> 映射到 <code>Message.channel_id</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"slack-bolt-sdk-events-api-双-socket\">Slack Bolt SDK：events API + 双 socket</h2><p>Slack 官方推荐 Bolt SDK（Node / Python / Java 三种 binding）。它统一了 events API（HTTP webhook）与 socket mode（WebSocket，避免开放公网入口）。OpenClaw 默认采用 socket mode——personal-agent 通常运行在本地或 NAT 后的机器上，没有稳定公网 HTTPS。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const app = new App({&#10;  token: process.env.SLACK_BOT_TOKEN,&#10;  appToken: process.env.SLACK_APP_TOKEN,&#10;  socketMode: true,&#10;});&#10;&#10;app.message(async ({ message, say }) =&gt; {&#10;  const unified = adapter.toMessage(message, &#39;slack&#39;);&#10;  const persona = await router.resolve(unified);&#10;  await persona.handle(unified, say);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  token: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SLACK_BOT_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  appToken: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SLACK_APP_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  socketMode: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">say</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adapter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> persona</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unified);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> persona.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unified, say);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Slack 把 channel 分为 <code>public_channel</code> / <code>private_channel</code> / <code>mpim</code> / <code>im</code> 四种，schema 在 <code>channel_type</code> 字段反映；DM 走 <code>im</code>，私聊群走 <code>mpim</code>——adapter 把这四种归并到统一 <code>Message.channel.kind</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"telegram-bot-api-long-poll-优先\">Telegram Bot API：long-poll 优先</h2><p>Telegram Bot API 是最轻量的一档：单一 token、单向 API、文档极简。两种实时模式：<code>getUpdates</code> long-poll（默认）或 <code>setWebhook</code>（需要 HTTPS 公网）。OpenClaw 选 long-poll 路径——personal-agent 部署门槛低，long-poll 在 chat 体量小时延迟可控（&lt; 1 秒）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def poll_loop():&#10;    offset = 0&#10;    while True:&#10;        resp = requests.get(&#10;            f&quot;https://api.telegram.org/bot{TOKEN}/getUpdates&quot;,&#10;            params={&quot;offset&quot;: offset, &quot;timeout&quot;: 30},&#10;            timeout=35,&#10;        )&#10;        for upd in resp.json()[&quot;result&quot;]:&#10;            offset = upd[&quot;update_id&quot;] + 1&#10;            adapter.dispatch(upd)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> poll_loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        resp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests.get(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.telegram.org/bot</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{TOKEN}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/getUpdates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: offset, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> upd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.json()[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> upd[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            adapter.dispatch(upd)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Telegram 的 message schema 在 <code>update.message</code> 里：<code>chat.id</code> 是负数表示群、正数表示 1:1；adapter 用符号位推断 channel kind。它<strong>不支持 user 身份</strong>——所有发送都是 bot。这是 personal-agent 在 Telegram 上的硬限制：用户无法以&quot;自己的身份&quot;发消息，只能用 bot 代理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"discord-js-gateway-interaction-based\">Discord.js gateway：interaction-based</h2><p>Discord 的 API 范式与前三家不同——以 gateway WebSocket 推送事件为主，HTTP 仅用于 reply / fetch。Discord.js 是 Node 上事实标准 SDK。OpenClaw 适配 Discord 时关注三件事：guild（服务器）层级权限、slash command interaction、ephemeral reply（只发送者可见）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const { Client, GatewayIntentBits } = require(&#39;discord.js&#39;);&#10;const client = new Client({&#10;  intents: [&#10;    GatewayIntentBits.Guilds,&#10;    GatewayIntentBits.GuildMessages,&#10;    GatewayIntentBits.MessageContent,&#10;    GatewayIntentBits.DirectMessages,&#10;  ],&#10;});&#10;&#10;client.on(&#39;messageCreate&#39;, async (msg) =&gt; {&#10;  if (msg.author.bot) return;&#10;  const unified = adapter.toMessage(msg, &#39;discord&#39;);&#10;  await router.dispatch(unified);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GatewayIntentBits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discord.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intents: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GatewayIntentBits.Guilds,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GatewayIntentBits.GuildMessages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GatewayIntentBits.MessageContent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GatewayIntentBits.DirectMessages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'messageCreate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (msg.author.bot) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adapter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discord'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unified);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Discord 的 <code>guild_id</code> + <code>channel_id</code> 形成两级嵌套，adapter 把 <code>guild_id</code> 映射到统一 <code>Message.parent_id</code>（对应路由 lookup 第 2 级 parent rule）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"matrix-protocol-联邦-e2e-加密\">Matrix protocol：联邦 + E2E 加密</h2><p>Matrix 是五者中唯一<strong>联邦协议</strong>——没有单一中央服务器，每个 homeserver 独立运营，房间在多个 homeserver 间同步。它支持 end-to-end 加密（Olm/Megolm），personal-agent 接入时必须维护 device key 与 session key 储存。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时通道</td>\n<td><code>/sync</code> long-poll（默认 30s timeout）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份</td>\n<td><code>@user:server.tld</code> 全局 id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>房间</td>\n<td><code>!roomid:server.tld</code> 跨 server 同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密</td>\n<td>Olm 1:1 / Megolm 群（per-device session）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adapter 库</td>\n<td>matrix-nio (Python) / matrix-js-sdk (JS)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenClaw 在 Matrix adapter 里保留 E2E session 在本地 sqlite——重启后必须能 decrypt 历史消息。这点比其他四家平台都重——但 Matrix 是少数支持 personal-agent &quot;完全自托管 + 端到端隐私&quot;的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五平台-message-schema-对照\">五平台 message schema 对照</h2><p>不同平台 schema 字段名差异巨大，adapter 层抽象为统一 <code>Message</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统一字段</th>\n<th>飞书</th>\n<th>Slack</th>\n<th>Telegram</th>\n<th>Discord</th>\n<th>Matrix</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Message.id</code></td>\n<td><code>event.message.message_id</code></td>\n<td><code>client_msg_id</code></td>\n<td><code>update_id</code></td>\n<td><code>id</code></td>\n<td><code>event_id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Message.channel_id</code></td>\n<td><code>event.message.chat_id</code></td>\n<td><code>channel</code></td>\n<td><code>chat.id</code></td>\n<td><code>channel_id</code></td>\n<td><code>room_id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Message.parent_id</code></td>\n<td>父群 <code>chat_id</code></td>\n<td>workspace id</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td><code>guild_id</code></td>\n<td>房间 alias</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Message.sender_id</code></td>\n<td><code>event.sender.sender_id</code></td>\n<td><code>user</code></td>\n<td><code>from.id</code></td>\n<td><code>author.id</code></td>\n<td><code>sender</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Message.text</code></td>\n<td><code>message.content</code></td>\n<td><code>text</code></td>\n<td><code>text</code></td>\n<td><code>content</code></td>\n<td><code>content.body</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenClaw 的 router 只看统一字段；adapter 负责 schema 翻译。新增第六种平台时只需要写新 adapter 实现 <code>toMessage</code> / <code>fromAction</code> 两个方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rate-limit-总览\">Rate limit 总览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>颗粒度</th>\n<th>默认上限</th>\n<th>突发处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>飞书</td>\n<td>应用 + tenant + endpoint</td>\n<td>100 QPS（多数接口）</td>\n<td>429 + retry-after</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slack</td>\n<td>tier1-4 + per-method</td>\n<td>tier3 ~50/min</td>\n<td>429 + retry-after</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Telegram</td>\n<td>bot 全局 + 单 chat</td>\n<td>全局 30/sec / 单 chat 1/sec</td>\n<td>429 + retry-after</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discord</td>\n<td>global + per-route bucket</td>\n<td>50/sec global</td>\n<td>bucket reset header</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Matrix</td>\n<td>服务器配置</td>\n<td>因 homeserver 而异</td>\n<td>429 + soft delay</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenClaw 的 outbound queue 在 adapter 层做 token-bucket，按平台不同配置。Discord 的 per-bucket rate limit 由 <code>X-RateLimit-Bucket</code> header 标识，比其他平台复杂——adapter 需要解析 header 并动态调整 bucket 计数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>以为 Telegram 支持 user 身份</strong>：Bot API 不支持。需要 user 身份的场景必须改用 MTProto（telethon / Pyrogram），但风险更大且违反 ToS。</li>\n<li><strong>飞书 webhook 签名忘记校验</strong>：直接信任 payload 会被伪造请求触发 persona action。<code>X-Lark-Signature</code> 必须校验。</li>\n<li><strong>Slack socket mode 与 events API 同时启用</strong>：会导致双重投递。生产二选一。</li>\n<li><strong>Discord intents 漏开 <code>MessageContent</code></strong>：Discord 2022 后默认不发送 message content，必须 verified bot 申请 intent；adapter 启动检查必须读取 intents 配置。</li>\n<li><strong>Matrix E2E key 丢失</strong>：device key 储存损坏后历史消息永远无法解密。adapter 应定期备份 session keys 到加密文件。</li>\n<li><strong>Rate limit 未做 retry</strong>：直接报错会让 OpenClaw 漏消息。adapter 必须对 429 + retry-after 做指数回退。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>五种主流 chat platform——飞书 / Slack / Telegram / Discord / Matrix——在 OAuth 流、实时通道、message schema、rate limit 四个维度都有差异。OpenClaw 用 adapter 层把这些差异收敛到统一 <code>Message</code> / <code>Action</code> 模型，router 与 personas runtime 才能跨平台工作。adapter 的核心责任是 schema 翻译 + 实时通道维护 + rate limit 队列；身份模型差异（飞书 / Slack 支持双身份、Telegram bot-only、Discord bot-only、Matrix user-only）反过来影响 personal-agent 在该平台能做什么。下一篇讲路由规则 DSL 如何把统一 <code>Message</code> 映射到正确 persona。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主流 chat platform 适配清单","id":"主流-chat-platform-适配清单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"飞书 Open API：bot 与 user 双身份","id":"飞书-open-api-bot-与-user-双身份"},{"level":2,"text":"Slack Bolt SDK：events API + 双 socket","id":"slack-bolt-sdk-events-api-双-socket"},{"level":2,"text":"Telegram Bot API：long-poll 优先","id":"telegram-bot-api-long-poll-优先"},{"level":2,"text":"Discord.js gateway：interaction-based","id":"discord-js-gateway-interaction-based"},{"level":2,"text":"Matrix protocol：联邦 + E2E 加密","id":"matrix-protocol-联邦-e2e-加密"},{"level":2,"text":"五平台 message schema 对照","id":"五平台-message-schema-对照"},{"level":2,"text":"Rate limit 总览","id":"rate-limit-总览"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"路由规则 DSL 语法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/routing-rules-syntax"}}